## 🎯 CHEAT SHEET

| Goal | Command |
|------|---------|
| List versions | `--list` |
| Search 11.126.0 (MOST COMMON) | `-v 11.126.0 -o targets.txt` |
| Search all versions | `--search-all -o all.txt` |
